# Third pass — 2026-08-09

Covering what the second pass left: JavaScript/Solidity dependencies, `zk-circuits`, and
`api-gateway`.

**Third-pass totals**: 5 findings — 4 confirmed, 1 observed. Two positives recorded.
**V23-24 is resolved**, and V23-24a was added to this section afterwards.

